      "content": "but it doesn't feel temporary. it feels like the reality of the situation. i see the way they talk to each other and then they go quiet when i walk by. it’s like i'm living in a reality where i've already been removed from the equation. it's just so exhausting having to pretend like i'm still part of the world when i'm clearly not. sometimes i just wish the outside would match how i feel on the inside. i just want the noise to stop.",
